OL,3,GNEWSAHauliers raise prices amid soaring
OL,4,Afuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We can't push those prices on to our
OL,7,Fcustomers, we'd just be pushed out."
OL,9,FFor Jonathon Clifft, rising fuel prices
OL,10,Fare forcing his waste management firm
OL,11,Finto difficult decisions.
OL,13,FThe business operates three vehicles
OL,14,Facross the West Midlands and Clifft
OL,15,Fsaid fuel "has become a strain". "We'll
OL,16,Fprobably have to lose a vehicle," he
OL,17,Fsaid, if the price hikes were to
OL,18,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
