OL,3,GNEWSAHauliers raise prices amid soaring
OL,4,Afuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FClifft's story echoes millions of
OL,7,Fmotorists and businesses across the
OL,8,Fcountry facing rising costs at the pump
OL,9,Fas UK diesel prices top #2 a litre for
OL,10,Ffirst time, according to the RAC.
